sequenceDiagram
    title Sequence Diagram: Proses Matching Engine (Calculate & Recommendation)
    autonumber

    actor P as Petugas / Administrator
    participant FE as Frontend (React)
    participant RT as Router
    participant MC as MatchingController
    participant DB as Database

    rect rgb(240, 249, 255)
    Note over P,DB: FASE 1 - Hitung Match Score (POST /api/matching/calculate)
    P->>FE: Pilih siswa, klik "Hitung Matching"
    FE->>RT: POST /api/matching/calculate { student_id }
    RT->>MC: dispatch ke MatchingController::calculate()
    MC->>MC: Auth::requireLogin() + resolveStudentId()

    MC->>DB: SELECT * FROM students WHERE id = :id
    DB-->>MC: data profil siswa
    MC->>DB: SELECT minat FROM student_interests WHERE student_id = :id
    DB-->>MC: daftar minat siswa
    MC->>DB: SELECT COUNT(*) FROM student_experiences WHERE student_id = :id
    DB-->>MC: jumlah pengalaman
    MC->>DB: SELECT kompetensi (JOIN student_competencies + competencies)
    DB-->>MC: daftar kompetensi siswa
    MC->>DB: SELECT keyword FROM keywords WHERE jurusan = :jurusan
    DB-->>MC: kamus kata kunci jurusan
    MC->>DB: SELECT lowongan aktif<br/>(JOIN company_requirements + companies WHERE status='Aktif')
    DB-->>MC: daftar lowongan aktif

    loop Untuk setiap lowongan aktif
        MC->>DB: SELECT jurusan_relevan & kompetensi_dibutuhkan<br/>(requirement_majors, requirement_competencies)
        DB-->>MC: kriteria lowongan
        MC->>MC: hitung skorKompetensi() -&gt; bobot 40%
        MC->>MC: hitung skorPengalaman() -&gt; bobot 20%
        MC->>DB: (jika perlu) SELECT bidang_jurusan_map
        DB-->>MC: mapping bidang-jurusan
        MC->>MC: hitung skorPendidikan() -&gt; bobot 15%
        MC->>MC: hitung skorBidangMinat() -&gt; bobot 15%
        MC->>MC: hitung skorPreferensi() -&gt; bobot 10%
        MC->>MC: Total = round(SUM(skor_i x bobot_i))<br/>Kategori = kategoriFromScore(Total)
        MC->>DB: INSERT INTO matching_results (5 skor komponen, total, category)
        DB-->>MC: matching_id
    end

    MC-->>RT: array hasil matching + breakdown per komponen
    RT-->>FE: 200 OK { results }
    FE-->>P: Tampilkan tabel Match Score per lowongan
    end

    rect rgb(252, 231, 243)
    Note over P,DB: FASE 2 - Rekomendasi Terurut (GET /api/recommendation/{studentId})
    P->>FE: Klik "Lihat Rekomendasi"
    FE->>RT: GET /api/recommendation/{studentId}
    RT->>MC: dispatch ke MatchingController::recommendation()
    MC->>MC: Ulangi seluruh proses hitung (FASE 1)<br/>via runForStudent()
    MC->>MC: usort(results) urutkan total_score DESC

    loop Untuk setiap hasil terurut
        MC->>DB: INSERT INTO recommendations (matching_id, rank, recommendation_date)
        DB-->>MC: OK
    end

    MC-->>RT: hasil terurut + nomor rank
    RT-->>FE: 200 OK { results (sorted) }
    FE-->>P: Tampilkan daftar rekomendasi rank #1, #2, #3, ...
    end

    Note over MC,DB: Catatan: hasil Match Score & rekomendasi bersifat DECISION SUPPORT (BR-10) -<br/>keputusan akhir penerimaan tetap di tangan Petugas & Perusahaan, bukan otomatis oleh sistem.
